Approved in §128 (Misho's „ყველა კი", 11 Oct) with the section text in
NIGHT_QUESTIONS BJ, word for word.

Once a month, the owner's own run — a regular conversation, owner
present, no goal, the same places the day's question may run — carries
the approved section asking, in the assistant's own words, for the
contacts saved since the last import. Only for someone whose reminder
switch is on and whose last real import is over 30 days old. It shares
BH's monthly mark (contact_import_reminded_at, migration 236), claimed in
one UPDATE: a person is reminded once a month, by push or in chat, never
both. Never beside the day's question; a failed read adds nothing.

Requires 0134 (the column and SYNC_REMINDER_DAYS).

